    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-prepositions-p04-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "除 + exception",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "除 introduces an exception to a scoped statement. State clearly which member is excluded and what remains true.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "除他以外，大家都来了。",
                "pinyin": "chú tā yǐwài ， dàjiā dōu lái le 。",
                "meaning": "Everyone except him has arrived.",
                "audio": "e4140994692e3fea9474ee0b7136b88c0bf8dc4bf80e572baa8bb070e5877776"
              },
              {
                "text": "除这本书外，我都看过。",
                "pinyin": "chú zhè běn shū wài ， wǒ dōu kàn guo 。",
                "meaning": "I have read all of them except this book.",
                "audio": "3eb021fad9061cd3926912db875981841f2d3fec677934a02a5c85df6191ec0d"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
